However, in my version of NetHack, (and I prefer this feature to the 3.1 
implementation) Stormbringer only decreases the confirm level by one.

             Normal Weapon   My Stormbringer    3.1 Stormbringer
            +--------------+------------------+-----------------+
Bad Critter | No Confirm   | No Confirm       | No Confirm      |
            +--------------+------------------+-----------------+
Peaceful    | Confirm      | No Confirm       | No Confirm      |
            +--------------+------------------+-----------------+
Tame (Pet)  | Stop         | Confirm          | No Confirm      |
            +--------------+------------------+-----------------+

I'd like to see my implementation in the next revision, 3.1.1...

